        "answer": {
          "short": "$-35x^3$",
          "worked": "$$T_r=\\binom{7}{r}(-1)^rx^r$$\nFor $x^3$, let $r=3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}T_3&=\\binom{7}{3}(-1)^3x^3\\\\T_3&=-35x^3\\end{align*}$$",
